{"card_id":"card-ad-fail-restore-destroyed-live-state","path":"kb/attack-defend/card-ad-fail-restore-destroyed-live-state.md","title":"Failure story: restored a whole tree and destroyed the state the checker needed","tags":["failure","restore","state","checker","negative-knowledge"],"stacks":["git","linux"],"aliases":["restore wiped flags","snapshot overwrote database","rollback lost data","old flags gone","whole tree restore"],"summary":"Check the restore's file list against the state-path list first; a whole-tree restore rolls data back to snapshot time, so earlier data the checker still reads disappears.","source_ids":["src-maplebacon-faustctf-patcher-bf21013c","src-enowars-engine-readme-7933cf37","src-enowars-checker-tenets-bf4b0ac7","src-d0gl0v3r-umcs2026-c85f0c19"],"content_origin":"researcher-authored","evidence_status":"unresolved","created_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","content_sha256":null}
