{"card_id":"card-ad-fail-context-switching-burnout","path":"kb/attack-defend/card-ad-fail-context-switching-burnout.md","title":"Failure story: context switching across codebases until the team burned out","tags":["failure","context-switching","coordination","small-team","negative-knowledge"],"stacks":["stack-agnostic"],"aliases":["too many codebases","burned out","one person holding everything","interrupted constantly","freeze queue"],"summary":"Count how many open problems one person holds, freeze their queue to one service until the next checkpoint, and route status questions to the board instead of the person.","source_ids":["src-duchyoftaco-misec-ructfe2019-332d8e5b","src-onemanparty-faustctf2025-6368aeaf","src-dttw-defcon2021-retro-14eb5491","src-ntt-enowars8-writeup-8b4ecb49"],"content_origin":"researcher-authored","evidence_status":"source-supported but untested","created_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","content_sha256":null}
{"card_id":"card-ad-fail-container-vm-exploit-mismatch","path":"kb/attack-defend/card-ad-fail-container-vm-exploit-mismatch.md","title":"Failure story: the exploit did not work because the environment was not the same","tags":["failure","environment","docker","exploit","negative-knowledge"],"stacks":["docker","linux"],"aliases":["exploit fails in docker","works on vm not container","cups port conflict","missing dependency","assumed patched"],"summary":"Compare running dependencies and port ownership before rewriting an exploit: a missing host dependency or an unrelated daemon on the port explains the failure without any patch being involved.","source_ids":["src-saarctf-2024-readme-6dacbfcc","src-maplebacon-ad-primer-23bd534f","src-c4tbuts4d-stayhomectf2022-61868263","src-iproute2-ss-manpage-fc58f455"],"content_origin":"researcher-authored","evidence_status":"source-supported but untested","created_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","content_sha256":null}
{"card_id":"card-ad-fail-binary-patch-broke-checker","path":"kb/attack-defend/card-ad-fail-binary-patch-broke-checker.md","title":"Failure story: patched a binary and broke the behaviour the checker graded","tags":["failure","binary","patching","checker","negative-knowledge"],"stacks":["linux","binary"],"aliases":["binary patch broke service","hex edit regression","no source service","patch offset wrong","binary exploit gone but faulty"],"summary":"Save the original binary and the legitimate request/response pair, rehearse the patch on a copy on another port, and keep the rollback as a file copy rather than a rebuild.","source_ids":["src-ntt-enowars8-writeup-8b4ecb49","src-dttw-defcon2021-retro-14eb5491","src-dttw-defcon2018-retro-83e7e6ea","src-maplebacon-faustctf-patcher-bf21013c"],"content_origin":"researcher-authored","evidence_status":"source-supported but untested","created_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T00:00:00Z","content_sha256":null}
